# CR 107.3, 601.2b: Blaze costs {X}{R}. The caster announces X = 3 and pays it;
# the spell's `SVar:X:Count$xPaid` reads that value when it resolves, so the
# opponent takes 3.
startturn human
advance 3
tapformana human 2 R
tapformana human 3 R
tapformana human 4 R
tapformana human 5 R
queue payx 3
queue paygeneric R
queue paygeneric R
queue paygeneric R
queue targets ai
castspell human 1
resolvestack
